+// wwe2k14 patch (Session 7c, NOOPSKIP): gpu_skip_noop_draws / gpu_skip_noop_draws_stats. Called by IssueDraw in
+// the fragment shader interlock path (either setting on) after the render target cache update, with the values the
+// draw would be drawn with. A draw can be skipped only if all of these hold:
