+//     is old & ~write mask | new & write mask, with new = old for kKeep; the back-face reference / masks / ops are
+//     used only for polygons with backface_enable (otherwise the front ones are copied). Normalized depth control
+//     is all 0 outside kColorDepth / kDepthOnly. Conservative: depth func never, replace with an equal reference
+//     and the like count as writes.
