+// wwe2k14 patch (Session 7c, TEXLOAD): marks inside a texture load, attributed to the anatomy row being prepared
+// (anatomy_gpu_row_). They chain with the row's other marks like any mark: each one's interval is the time since
+// the previous mark of the submission, so the draw's pre mark then measures only what is recorded after the load.
+void VulkanCommandProcessor::GpuMarkTextureLoad(TextureLoadMark mark) {
+  if (!gpu_marks_active_) {
